<p>Your cookware isn’t just a tool — it’s the surface your food spends the most time touching. That means the materials you cook on can either protect your health or expose you to hidden toxins that build up over time. In this Clean Code guide, we’ll break down which cookware types are safest, which to avoid, and how to maintain them for years of healthy meals.</p>

