<li><strong>Look for Certifications:</strong> Prioritize materials with certifications like GREENGUARD, Cradle to Cradle, and FSC (Forest Stewardship Council) for those including wood. These certifications ensure compliance with environmental and health standards. Also, consider Energy Star ratings where applicable to signify superior energy efficiency.</li>
