    affiliateUrl: "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005OCTJ24?tag=thecleancod02-20",
    description:
      "Top-rated eco-friendly product for Eco-Friendly Ways to Keep Your Home Cool Without Air Conditioning. Available on Amazon.",
