    title: "Urban Beekeeping for Beginners: The Complete Guide to Raising Healthy Bees in Cities, Rooftops & Small Spaces (Getting Started with Beekeeping Book 13)",
    image: "/images/products/b0ghs5mxws.jpg",
    affiliateUrl: "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GHS5MXWS?tag=thecleancod02-20",
